---
title: "Durable logical AI turn"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty: No receipt
  Running: IN_PROGRESS
  Pending: Awaiting recovery
  Success: SUCCEEDED
  Cancelled: CANCELLED
  Failed: FAILED
  Gone: Result removed
  Empty --> Running: Unique claim
  Empty --> Cancelled: Tombstone first
  Running --> Pending: Disconnect or crash
  Pending --> Pending: Retry returns 202
  Running --> Running: Retry returns 202
  Running --> Success: Atomic commit
  Running --> Cancelled: Cancel wins
  Pending --> Cancelled: Fence uncertain work
  Running --> Failed: Definitive failure
  Success --> Success: Replay same result
  Success --> Gone: Delete owned result
  Gone --> Gone: Retry returns 410
  Cancelled --> Cancelled: Reject late work
  Failed --> Failed: Replay failure
